<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Alcom '96 net rises 3.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Alcom '96 net rises 3.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  29.33   vs	  28.49</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 22.8    vs	  22.4</p>
<p>    Turnover		   249.57   vs	 261.33</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    29.80   vs	  29.04</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.02   vs	    -</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	     -     vs	    -</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 6.0    vs	   6.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Aluminium Company of Malaysia is engaged in manufacturing and trading of aluminium sheet, foil and extrusion products.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
